# Hoogle MCP server development guide

In this file, "you" means Cursor, and "I" means the programmer.

## Project management

This project is managed by `hatch`. Installing dependencies must be done in its environment.

## Validation (mandatory gate)

1. Whenever you modify any files, you must execute the validation commands below in the given order.  
2. If a command exits with a non-zero status, you must automatically fix the issue and rerun the entire list until every command succeeds.  
3. After all commands succeed, you may stop editing or proceed to next.

```sh
hatch test --all
hatch run format:run
hatch run type-check:run --all
hatch run security:run
```
